# Secrets for CalibreFast, as environment variables. Copy to calibrefast.env
# (which git ignores) and keep it readable only by the service's user:
#
#     chmod 600 calibrefast.env
#
# The systemd unit in deploy/systemd/ reads it if it's there. Leave out what
# you don't use. See docs/OAUTH.md.

# CF_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# CF_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# CF_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# CF_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Offer Google Books in the metadata editor (an API key with the Books API).
# CF_GOOGLE_BOOKS_KEY=

# Identify series on Hardcover (Missing books). A personal API token from
# https://hardcover.app/account/api with the read:catalog scope only.
# CF_HARDCOVER_TOKEN=
